  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nSequence = 5, 10, 15, ...\n\n**Formula used:**\n\nnth term of AP = a + (n − 1)d\n\n**Calculation:**\n\na = 5\n\nd = 5\n\nn = 12\n\n⇒ T₁₂ = 5 + (12 − 1) × 5\n\n⇒ 5 + 11 × 5\n\n⇒ 5 + 55\n\n⇒ 60\n\n**∴ 12th term = 60.**",
